#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.oudu_host_view_form_iot
msgid "Point of Sale: under Configuration › Settings › Connected Devices, enable IoT Box and enter this host's address as its IP Address to use scanners, scales and receipt printing, or enable ePos Printer and enter it as the Epson Printer IP for receipts only. No Oudu module is required for this."
msgstr "POS營業點：在「配置」›「設定」›「連接設備」中啟用「IoT 盒子」並將此主機的位址填入「IP 位址」，即可使用掃碼槍、電子秤與收據列印；或啟用「ePOS打印機」並填入「Epson 印表機 IP」，僅用於收據。無需任何 Oudu 模組。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Point of Sale: under Configuration › Settings › Connected Devices, enable IoT Box and enter an Oudu IoT host's address as its IP Address to use scanners, scales and receipt printing, or enable ePos Printer and enter it as the Epson Printer IP for receipts only. No Oudu module is required for this."
msgstr "POS營業點：在「配置」›「設定」›「連接設備」中啟用「IoT 盒子」並將 Oudu IoT 主機的位址填入「IP 位址」，即可使用掃碼槍、電子秤與收據列印；或啟用「ePOS打印機」並填入「Epson 印表機 IP」，僅用於收據。無需任何 Oudu 模組。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Register Oudu IoT hosts on your local network and test them from this browser."
msgstr "登記區域網路內的 Oudu IoT 主機，並在此瀏覽器中測試連線。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
