msgstr "Oudu IoT 產品概覽"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Native Odoo ESP32 edge hardware gateway"
msgstr "原生 Odoo ESP32 邊緣硬體閘道"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Connect scanners, scales, receipt printers and cameras to standard Odoo through the native IoT Box and ePOS interfaces. Devices work without this module; it adds a host list, connection tests and gateway shortcuts."
msgstr "透過原生 IoT Box 與 ePOS 介面，將掃碼槍、電子秤、收據印表機和攝影機接入標準 Odoo。裝置無需本模組即可使用；本模組提供主機清單、連線測試與閘道入口。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Online flashing needs desktop Chrome, Edge or Firefox. Connection tests need Chrome or Edge."
msgstr "線上燒錄需使用桌面版 Chrome、Edge 或 Firefox；連線測試需使用 Chrome 或 Edge。"

